        "answer": {
          "short": "$6x^2+33x+45$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3(x+3)(2x+5)&=3(2x^2+5x+6x+15)\\\\&=3(2x^2+11x+15)\\\\&=6x^2+33x+45\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p4-q3-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$2(2a+1)(3a-4)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$12a^2-10a-8$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2(2a+1)(3a-4)&=2(6a^2-8a+3a-4)\\\\&=2(6a^2-5a-4)\\\\&=12a^2-10a-8\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p4-q3-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$2(2y+1)(y+2)+3(y-2)(2y+3)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10y^2+7y-14$",
          "worked": "Expand each product, then distribute the outside multipliers.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2(2y+1)(y+2)+3(y-2)(2y+3)&=2(2y^2+4y+y+2)+3(2y^2+3y-4y-6)\\\\&=2(2y^2+5y+2)+3(2y^2-y-6)\\\\&=4y^2+10y+4+6y^2-3y-18\\\\&=10y^2+7y-14\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p4-q3-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$5(b+2)(2b+1)-3(b-1)(b-3)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$7b^2+37b+1$",
          "worked": "Distribute the factor $-3$ to every term of the second expanded product.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}5(b+2)(2b+1)-3(b-1)(b-3)&=5(2b^2+b+4b+2)-3(b^2-3b-b+3)\\\\&=5(2b^2+5b+2)-3(b^2-4b+3)\\\\&=10b^2+25b+10-3b^2+12b-9\\\\&=7b^2+37b+1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      }
    ]
